{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42179","headline":"送郝郎中爲浙西判官 · 徐铉","name":"送郝郎中爲浙西判官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大藩从事本优贤，幕府仍当北固前。\n花绕楼台山倚郭，寺临江海水连天。\n恐君到即忘归日，忆我游曾历二年。\n若许他时作闲伴，殷勤爲买钓鱼船。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42179.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42179","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}